flowchart TD
Route[URL com tenantSlug]
Callable[resolvePublicTenant]
SlugMap[publicAtelierSlugs slug]
Atelier[ateliers atelierId active]
Public[publicAteliers configuração]
Status[Estado disponível ou erro]
Landing[Landing e formulário do tenant]
Intake[createPublicQuoteRequest]
Request[Solicitação sob atelierId resolvido]
Pending[Referência pendente e path Storage]
Upload[Upload validado pelo backend]
Route --> Callable
Callable --> SlugMap
SlugMap --> Atelier
Atelier --> Public
Public --> Status
Status --> Landing
Landing --> Intake
Intake --> Request
Request --> Pending
Pending --> Upload
